## Fix Lakebase project name for 08x dry-run deploy

Context: Preparing a parallel `08x` instance deploy. Dry-run failed because
`DEFAULT_LAKEBASE_PROJECT` used underscores while the live Lakebase project is
hyphenated (`ontobricks-demo-08-registry`). Unit tests still expected the old
`07x` default instance id after `DEFAULT_INSTANCE_ID` was bumped to `08x`.

Changes:

1. scripts/deploy.config.sh
   Set `DEFAULT_LAKEBASE_PROJECT` to the live hyphenated project name
   `ontobricks-demo-08-registry` so db-… resolution succeeds.
2. tests/units/settings/test_deploy_instance_id.py
   Update default-id expectations from `07x` to `08x` to match deploy.config.

Modified files:
- scripts/deploy.config.sh
- tests/units/settings/test_deploy_instance_id.py

Tests: 4787 passed, 276 skipped, 5 deselected, 1 xfailed (`uv run --frozen pytest -q -m "not scenario"`)
